 -->\n<h4 class=\"item-name\">\n  <a href=\"https://untappd.com/b/green-bench-mead-and-cider-bocage/6181740\" class=\"item-title-color untappd-beer-url\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    \n    <span id=\"bocage\">Bocage<\/span>\n    \n  <\/a>\n  <span class=\"item-style item-title-color\"><span class=\"item-category\">Dry English Inspired Cider w/ a Blend of Bittersweet &amp; Bittersharp Apples<\/span><\/span>\n<\/h4>\n\n<!-- Beer Details -->\n<div class=\"item-meta item-title-color\">\n  <span class=\"item-abv\">7.1% ABV<\/span>\n  \n  \n\n    <span class=\"brewery\">\n      <a href=\"https://untappd.com/brewery/184191\" class=\"item-title-color\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n        \n      <\/a>\n    <\/span>\n\n  \n\n  \n<\/div>\n\n<!-- Item Description -->\n  <div class=\"item-description item-title-color\">\n    <a class=\"link-font-color ut-more hide\"\n       href=\"#\"\n       aria-label=\"More Info\"\n       role=\"button\"\n       aria-describedby=\"bocage\"\n       aria-expanded=\"false\"\n       aria-controls=\"bocage_description\"\n    >\n      More Info &#9656;\n    <\/a>\n    <p class=\"link-font-color show-less item-title-color\" id=\"bocage_description\">Although the name is French, this may be the most English expression in a Green Bench cider to date. Lightly carbonated and bone dry, it showcases a blend dominated by Ellis Bitter, Kingston Black, Dabinette, and Binet Rouge —classic bittersweet and bittersharp apples known for their structure and complexity. Notes of leather, fruit skins, and subtle earthiness lead the palate, supported by a lasting, tannic astringency that finishes crisp and thoroughly dry.<\/p>\n    <a href=\"#\"\n       class=\"ut-less hide link-font-color\"\n       aria-label=\"Less Info\"\n       role=\"button\"\n       aria-describedby=\"bocage\"\n       aria-expanded=\"true\"\n       aria-controls=\"bocage_description\"\n    >\n      Less Info &#9652;\n    <\/a>\n  <\/div>\n\n\n      <!